    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10428" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-scĭo</span></b> , īre,
			v. a. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To be conscious</i> of wrong: nil sibi, *
